  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウルサス農民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "うわあああああああ！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウルサス農民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "火！？　火だ！！　うわああああ熱い！　熱い！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウルサス農民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "助けてくれ！！！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "パパ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歩哨",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "なんてことだ！　早く、早く消せ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "せがれが、わしのせがれが！　畜生……この感染した畜生め！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ひいぃ！　火、火が大きすぎる！　ゴホッゴホッゴホッ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "この畜生め！　死んでもお前を呪ってやる……呪ってやるぞ！！　ああ、皇帝陛下！　この忌々しい感染者どもに罰を！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あ……あぁ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "もう後戻りはできない。\nここで起きたことは、タルラ以外に知る者はいない。\nそしてこれ以降のことは、多くの者がよく知っている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "アーミヤは目を開いた。\n彼女の涙はまだ乾いていない。だが、すでに彼女は全てを見た。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "――！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "どうしてここにコータスがいる？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "アーミヤ！　気をつけろ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
